{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "SecurityServicesAdminAccess",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "guardduty:*",
        "securityhub:*",
        "config:*",
        "accessanalyzer:*"
      ],
      "Resource": "*"
    }
  ]
}


members - rahul.bhat@dc.gov / abdulkadir.harun@dc.gov

I need permissions to SYS views for the SYSMON user. Please run the following grant statements on VECTORDB/dc1oraprd7.dc.gov:
GRANT SELECT ON SYS.V_$ACCESS TO SYSMON;
GRANT SELECT ON SYS.V_$SESSION TO SYSMON;
GRANT SELECT ON SYS.V_$SESSION_EVENT TO SYSMON;
GRANT SELECT ON SYS.V_$SESSTAT TO SYSMON;
GRANT SELECT ON SYS.V_$STATNAME TO SYSMON;
Thanks.

CREATE USER PSOCFORO
  IDENTIFIED BY Psocforo#987
  DEFAULT TABLESPACE USERS
  TEMPORARY TABLESPACE TEMP
  PROFILE DEFAULT
  ACCOUNT UNLOCK;

Grant connect to PSOCFORO;

grant select on PS_DC_BUD_DATA_IB to PSOCFORO;
grant select on PS_DC_RET_DATA_IBA to PSOCFORO;
grant select on  PS_DC_SAL_DATA_IBA to PSOCFORO;

CREATE USER PSOCTORO
  IDENTIFIED BY Psinternal#987
  DEFAULT TABLESPACE USERS
  TEMPORARY TABLESPACE TEMP
  PROFILE DEFAULT
  ACCOUNT UNLOCK;


Grant connect to PSOCTORO;
grant select on PS_DC_BUD_DATA_IB to PSOCTORO;
grant select on PS_DC_RET_DATA_IBA to PSOCTORO;
grant select on  PS_DC_SAL_DATA_IBA to PSOCTORO;

Sample PL/SQL block:
declare
  l_geom_wkt            clob;
  l_geom_from           sdo_geometry;
begin
  l_geom_wkt := 'POINT (10 10)';
  dbms_output.put_line('Instance: ' || upper (SYS_CONTEXT('USERENV','INSTANCE_NAME')));
  dbms_output.put_line(dbms_lob.substr(l_geom_wkt,dbms_lob.getlength(l_geom_wkt),1));
  l_geom_from := sdo_util.from_wktgeometry(l_geom_wkt);
end;
/
If above block is called from GEOPRD1, the call (SDO_UTIL.FROM_WKTGEOMETRY) works. When called on GEOPRD2, it generates this error:
ORA-29532: Java call terminated by uncaught Java exception: java.lang.NullPointerException
ORA-06512: at "MDSYS.SDO_JAVA_STP", line 76
ORA-06512: at "MDSYS.SDO_UTIL", line 6744
ORA-06512: at line 8
29532. 00000 -  "Java call terminated by uncaught Java exception: %s"
*Cause:    A Java exception or error was signaled and could not be
           resolved by the Java code.
*Action:   Modify Java code, if this behavior is not intended.

This issue affects the HSEMA-Washington Gas ETL since the data is delivered as WKT.

ARCHBPRD_2023 =

